BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Post Alley Film Festival
DTSTART:20260321T180000Z
DTEND:20260322T014500Z
DTSTAMP:20260321T180000Z
UID:86ZtSkIpXx
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 448 mins (7h28m)\n\nPresented by Women in Film Seatt
 le A day of woman-centric & eccentric short films from around the block an
 d around the world. Twenty-five creatively diverse short film stories from
  11 countries in 6 thematic groups: Oh Mother\, Fantasy\, Family Matters\,
  Choices\, Docs Rock\, and A Lighter Side.  There’s a break for lunch\, 
 stretch time\, Q&A’s\, an invitational reception after the screenings\, 
 a silent auction and raffle during the fest. Your ticket helps secure the 
 future of Post Alley Film Festival and provide a venue for women’s filmw
 ork.  SCHEDULE10:30am - Doors open11:00am - Seating & welcome by Virgin
 ia Bogert\, PAFF Founder/Director11:10am - Oh Mother12:30pm - Lunch Break
 1:35pm - Fantasy2:00pm - Choices3:10pm - Family Matters4:50pm - Docs Rock5
 :55pm - The Lighter Side6:55pm - End of Festival7:00pm - 8:45pm Reception\
 n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/post-alley-film-festival\n\nEst
 imated start: 11:15
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Andre is an Idiot
DTSTART:20260411T000000Z
DTEND:20260411T015500Z
DTSTAMP:20260411T000000Z
UID:74nKhnxE23
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 97 mins (1h37m)\n\nAndre\, a brilliant idiot\, is dy
 ing because he didn’t get a colonoscopy. His sobering diagnosis\, comple
 te irreverence\, and insatiable curiosity\, send him on an unexpected jour
 ney learning how to die happily and ridiculously without losing his sense 
 of humor.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/andre-is-an-idiot\n\n
 Estimated start: 17:15
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
